### -------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Login com credenciais inválidas (deve retornar 401)
### -------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naoexiste@test.com",
  "password": "senhaerrada"
}
